                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
                "description": "Optional. A client-generated key (a UUID is ideal). Retrying with the same key returns the original order instead of placing a second one; reusing it with a different body is a 409.",
                "disabled": true
