    {
      "name": "7 - Realized P/L",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /pnl/preview",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/pnl/preview?symbol={{symbol}}&qty=",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "pnl",
                "preview"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "symbol",
                  "value": "{{symbol}}",
                  "description": "e.g. NVDA",
                  "disabled": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "qty",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "shares to sell",
                  "disabled": false
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "The FIFO cost basis a sell of `qty` shares would match against, today.\n\nThis is what lets the order ticket say \"you bought these shares at X\"\n*before* the trade, using the same lot walk that will record the realized\nfigure after the fill \u2014 so the preview and the history can never quote\ntwo different methods. Read-only: nothing is matched, nothing is written.\n\nThe gain itself is not computed here, deliberately. The ticket multiplies\nagainst a quote that changes every few seconds; shipping the cost basis\nonce and letting the display do the last subtraction beats re-asking the\nledger on every tick. `cost_basis` is null when no open lot covers the\nsale (history gap, or selling more than held) \u2014 display \"unknown\", never\nzero."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /pnl/realized",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/pnl/realized",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "pnl",
                "realized"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "after",
                  "value": "2026-08-01",
                  "description": "YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "until",
                  "value": "2026-08-31",
                  "description": "YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Realized P/L over a date range: the total and a per-symbol breakdown.\n\n`trades` counts **sell fills**, not round trips: one sell that consumed\nthree lots is one trade here, because that is the event the user performed\nand the row we stored.\n\nAn account that has never sold anything gets `{\"total\": \"0.00\",\n\"by_symbol\": [], \"method\": \"FIFO\"}` - not a 404. \"Nothing realized yet\" is\na perfectly good answer."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
